<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals committee to discuss Portuguese maize.</title>
<headline>EU cereals committee to discuss Portuguese maize.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's, cereals management committee is due to discuss the import of 150,000 tonnes of maize into Portugal on Wednesday, an EU official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The item has been listed for discussion,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The committee is also scheduled to deal with export refunds for processed products in addition to the usual weekly tenders.</p>
</text>
